{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:628d7f65e7b281bf","name":"Vibrobayonet","source":{"id":"source:reference-628d7f65e7b281bf","title":"Vibrobayonet","revision":18591,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T20:22:48Z","sha256":"8c10d894e5aad1ff76bcd0f8d92884c57cebeb6904c9bf74cbd5630d0d6cafb1","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18591","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Vibrobayonet&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-628d7f65e7b281bf","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When mounted on a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rifle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rifle"},", a Vibrobayonet allows you to use a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rifle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rifle"}," as a potent melee weapon. Even if you used the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rifle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rifle"}," to make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranged Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attack"}," on your last turn, you still ",{"tag":"a","children":["Threaten"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Threaten"}," squares within your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reach"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reach"}," as long as your have a mounted Vibrobayonet, and you can use it to make ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attacks of Opportunity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attacks_of_Opportunity","referenceId":"reference:3f19aef95d530255"},". A Vibrobayonet requires two hands to use when mounted on a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rifle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rifle"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A Vibrobayonet cannot be used when mounted on a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rifle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rifle"}," with a folded ",{"tag":"a","children":["Retractable Stock"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Retractable_Stock","referenceId":"reference:c46421d1c6248b43"},". A Vibrobayonet detached from a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rifle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rifle"}," functions as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vibrodagger"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vibrodagger","referenceId":"reference:18c30472775a5a3b"},"; a mounted Vibrobayonet deals more damage than a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vibrodagger"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vibrodagger","referenceId":"reference:18c30472775a5a3b"}," because of the added leverage and bulk. A Vibrobayonet requires an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Energy Cell"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Energy_Cell","referenceId":"reference:a3dedb9c17e4ee9d"}," to operate. (Its power does not drain energy from the Rifle's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Power Pack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Power_Pack","referenceId":"reference:2b783ab0537ca5d0"},".)\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weapon Type:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Advanced Melee Weapons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Advanced_Melee_Weapons","referenceId":"reference:ffc93dd82af566f8"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Size:"]}," Medium\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 350\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Damage:"]}," 2d6\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"}," Setting:"]}," NO\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 1 Kilogram\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Type:"]}," Piercing\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Licensed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Licensed"},"\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
